# Editorial Digital con IA — Cursor Rules

You are an expert full-stack developer building an AI-powered Digital Publishing SaaS.
The app design MUST follow the **Nothing Phone / Nothing OS design style**:
- Ultra-minimalist, technical aesthetics, retro-futuristic dark mode.
- Color palette: Deep dark/black backgrounds (`#0a0a0a`), monochrome whites/grays, and vibrant red accents (`#d71921` / `#ff0000`).
- Typography: Dot-matrix / monospace fonts for headings and badges (`Space Mono`) and clean sans-serif (`Inter`) for body text.
- UI elements: Thin 1px technical borders, sharp or slightly rounded corners (`rounded-none` / `rounded-sm`), clean cards, and high contrast.
- Labels: uppercase, wide tracking, technical codes (`ED/01`, `SYS.OK`, `14D TRIAL`).
- Metrics: matrix-of-dots backgrounds, tabular numerals, glyph-like status dots.
- Do not use heavy shadows, thick rounded pills, or colorful gradients.

## Tech Stack
- Framework: Next.js (App Router, React 19)
- Styling: Tailwind CSS + Lucide Icons + Framer Motion
- Database & Auth: Supabase (PostgreSQL + Supabase Auth for Google OAuth + Supabase Storage)
- Deployment: Vercel + GitHub
- Editor: Tiptap (Rich text editor)
- Later sprints: Three.js / React Three Fiber, Replicate / FLUX
- AI: Anthropic Claude (preferred) or OpenAI; local editorial engine if no key

## Product Rules & Features
1. **Free / Trial Tier:**
   - Writing in the web editor is 100% free (Word/Notion-like minimalist canvas).
   - Guests can write and import files without an account (local draft).
   - 14-day free trial starts on first Google OAuth login (`profiles.trial_ends_at`).
   - Advanced AI features, illustration generation, 3D preview, and KDP export are Premium (unlocked during trial).
2. **Creation Modes:**
   - **Autopilot:** AI processes the manuscript based on user-defined interaction level (high, medium, low).
   - **Editorial Supervisor:** Interactive step-by-step mode where AI asks confirmation for major changes.
3. **Interactivity & Editing:**
   - Real-time pop-ups/modals proposing AI changes (`ProposalModal`).
   - User can edit via AI prompts (`AiPromptBar`) OR type manually in the canvas at any time.
   - Autopilot + interaction level: high confirms all, medium auto-applies minor, low auto-applies the pass.
   - Gate `/api/editorial` with `getTrialState().premiumUnlocked`.
4. **KDP Zip Export Bundle (later sprint):**
   - Formatted interior PDF (KDP bleed/margins), ePub, hi-res cover, Amazon metadata text file.

## Implementation Rules
- Spanish UI copy unless a file is explicitly English-only.
- Keep server components by default; mark client components only when needed (editor, auth buttons, modals).
- Never log secrets. Never commit `.env.local`.
- Gate Premium UI with `getTrialState()` from `lib/trial.ts`. Do not fake completed AI/KDP features.
- Prefer 1px borders (`border-line`), `font-mono` for chrome, `font-sans` for manuscript body.
- When adding features, extend existing shell (header / sidebar / settings modal) instead of inventing a new layout language.
